This project is licensed under the **MIT License** with the following **strict non-commercial restrictions**:

1. **No Commercial Sale**: No individual or organization **is allowed** to sell the source code, modified source code, or the compiled executable (`main.exe`) of this project for direct commercial gain, paid downloads, or any form of commercial profit.
2. **No Paid Bundling**: It is strictly forbidden to bundle this project as a paid component or plug-in within other commercial/paid software or services.
3. **Free Distribution Allowed**: You are completely free to share and distribute this project, provided it remains **100% free, open-source, and carries the original author attribution** (Author: 吴迪胡桃大王 / Biu~happy~~).
